    s help                          Show this help message

${BOLD}SUPPORTED TOOLS & ALIASES:${RESET}
    ${CYAN}wifi${RESET}                        Wi-Fi network & scanning manager
    ${CYAN}bluetooth${RESET} (bt)               Bluetooth devices & battery manager
    ${CYAN}ports${RESET} (port, net)            Live ports, listening sockets & process killer
    ${CYAN}share${RESET}                       Samba folders & Hamachi VPN sharing
    ${CYAN}nixos${RESET} (gens)                 NixOS generations & rollback manager
    ${CYAN}service${RESET} (services)           Systemd user & system services
    ${CYAN}disk${RESET} (storage)               Partitions, USB auto-mount/eject & Nix GC
    ${CYAN}task${RESET} (tasks)                 Process & Mango Wayland window controller
